sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant Pods as vLLM/SGLang Pods
    participant Prom as Prometheus/Thanos<br/>9090-9091/TCP HTTPS
    participant WVA as WVA Controller<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant HPA as HPA / KEDA<br/>ScaledObject
    participant Deploy as Deployment / LWS

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over Pods,WVA: Flow 1: Saturation-Based Autoscaling Loop
        WVA->>Prom: PromQL query (KV cache, queue depth,<br/>token throughput, ITL)<br/>HTTPS/TLS 1.2+ | Bearer Token (SA)
        Prom-->>WVA: Metric values (per-pod, per-variant)
        Note over WVA: Saturation/Queueing Engine analysis<br/>Analyzer → Optimizer → Limiter → Enforcer
        Note over WVA: Emit wva_desired_replicas gauge
        Prom->>WVA: Scrape /metrics endpoint<br/>HTTPS/8443 | TLS | Bearer Token
        HPA->>Prom: Query wva_desired_replicas<br/>(via prometheus-adapter or KEDA trigger)<br/>HTTPS | Bearer Token
        HPA->>K8sAPI: Update scale subresource<br/>HTTPS/443 | TLS | SA Token
        K8sAPI->>Deploy: Scale replicas
    end

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note over WVA,Deploy: Flow 2: Scale-from-Zero (Direct Scaling)
        WVA->>K8sAPI: Get Deployment/LWS (replicas=0)<br/>HTTPS/443 | TLS 1.2+ | Bearer Token (SA)
        WVA->>K8sAPI: Patch scale subresource (replicas=N)<br/>HTTPS/443 | TLS 1.2+ | Bearer Token (SA)
        K8sAPI->>Deploy: Scale from zero
    end

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note over Pods,WVA: Flow 3: Pod Scraping (Alternative Collection)
        WVA->>K8sAPI: List Pods/Services for target<br/>HTTPS/443 | Bearer Token (SA)
        WVA->>Pods: GET /metrics (direct scrape)<br/>HTTP/HTTPS | Optional TLS | Optional Bearer Token
        Pods-->>WVA: Raw Prometheus metrics
        Note over WVA: ownerRef chain walk<br/>(Pod → ReplicaSet → Deployment/LWS)<br/>LRU cache (4096 entries)
    end
